Answer:
Task 1 – Create Jira Scrum Project

Steps:
Go to Jira Cloud and create a free account.
Log in to Jira.
Click Create project.
Select the Scrum template.
Enter a project name, for example Demo Scrum Project.
Click Create project.
Open the Backlog or Board section.
Check that the Scrum board is empty.
Take a screenshot of the empty Scrum board.


